UNC6293 phishing campaigns tend to be small in scope, usually targeting fewer than five users at a time, and the application names and lures observed by GTIG tend to focus on diplomatic themes and upcoming conferences or meetings, such as those documented in [December 2025 by Volexity](https://www.volexity.com/blog/2025/12/04/dangerous-invitations-russian-threat-actor-spoofs-european-security-events-in-targeted-phishing-attacks/).

